@startuml SD01_Connect
!include _style.iuml
title SD-01  Connect safety monitor (UC-01)  — REQ-01, REQ-02, REQ-05, REQ-48, REQ-55

actor Imager
participant "NINA\nSafetyMonitorChooser" as NINA
participant ":AllskySafetyMonitorProvider" as Prov
participant ":AllskySafetyMonitorDevice" as Dev
participant "MonitorHost\n.Instance" as Host
participant "PluginSettingsStore\n.Instance" as Store
participant ":MonitorServiceBuilder" as Builder
participant ":MonitorService" as Svc
participant ":MountWatcher" as MW
participant ":NinaMountStateSource" as Mount
participant "ITelescopeMediator" as TM

== NINA start-up ==
NINA -> Prov ** : new(IProfileService, ITelescopeMediator)  [MEF import]
NINA -> Prov : GetEquipment()
Prov -> Dev ** : new(profileService, telescopeMediator)
Prov --> NINA : [ AllskySafetyMonitorDevice ]
note right of NINA : Device listed in\nEquipment → Safety Monitor (REQ-01)

== Connect ==
Imager -> NINA : select device, Connect
NINA -> Dev : Connect(ct)
activate Dev
Dev -> Host : StartAsync(profileService, telescopeMediator)
activate Host
alt already running
  Host --> Dev : (no change)
else not running
  Host -> Mount ** : new(telescopeMediator)
  Host -> Host : ports = SystemClock, NinaSiteLocationSource,\nNovasAstroCalculator, NinaLogSink, mount, credentials,\nWpfFrameDecoder, ReferenceCaptured = Store.SaveReference
  Host -> Builder : Build(() => Store.Current, ports)
  Builder -> MW ** : new(mount, () => Mount.PollIntervalS)
  Builder -> Svc ** : new(cycle, guard, interval, …, MW)
  Builder --> Host : service
  Host -> Svc : Start()
  activate Svc
  Svc -> Svc : launch background loop\n(status = Starting, unsafe)
  Svc -> MW : Start()  (reads the mount every 2 s)
  MW -> Mount : GetCurrent()
  Mount -> TM : GetInfo()
  Host -> Host : raise RunningChanged
end
Host --> Dev
deactivate Host
Dev -> Host : subscribe SnapshotAvailable
Dev --> NINA : true  (Connected)
deactivate Dev
NINA -> Dev : IsSafe
Dev -> Host : CurrentStatus
Dev --> NINA : false  (Starting)
== First cycle (background task) ==
Svc -> Store : Current  (read every cycle)
Store --> Svc : MonitorSettings (JSON, REQ-56)
note over Svc : Saved settings apply from the next cycle.\nIsSafe stays false until a safe decision.
@enduml
